    <td style="padding-left:0.037in;vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;padding-right:0.037in;text-align:left;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:2.65pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;min-width:fit-content;">Approx. %</font></p></td>
